{
  "category": "Virtual Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. Capable of moving freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. Capable of moving freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "The only POKéMON people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a manmade POKéMON. Since it doesn't breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "A manmade POKéMON that came about as a result of re search. It is programmed with only basic motions.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "An artificial POKéMON created due to extensive research, it can perform only what is in its program.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A PORYGON is copy- protected so it cannot be duplicated.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the most advanced technologies, scientists finally succeeded in making the first artificial POKéMON.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. It is capable of moving freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "platinum"
