      "text": "A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "A man-made Pokémon that came about as a result of research. It is programmed with only basic motions.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pokémon that consists entirely of programming code. It is capable of moving freely in cyberspace.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Porygon is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This Pokémon is copy protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Porygon is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This Pokémon is copy protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly 20 years ago, it was artificially created, utilizing the latest technology of the time.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can convert its body into digital data, which enables it to enter cyberspace.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon was created using the cutting-edge science of 20 years ago, so many parts of it have since become obsolete.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was built 20 years ago by scientists who dreamed of exploring space. Their dreams have yet to come true.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The only Pokémon that people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "The only Pokémon that people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "State-of-the-art technology was used to create Porygon. It was the first artificial Pokémon to be created via computer programming.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "In recent years, this species has been very helpful in cyberspace. These Pokémon will go around checking to make sure no suspicious data exists.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has no discernible heartbeat and does not seem to draw breath, and yet it appears to function without issue. I cannot even begin to explain this utterly bizarre anomaly.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
